# Jeremy-Assets

Public image CDN repository for blog and technical documentation.

This repo is served via jsDelivr CDN.

---

## Usage

Base URL format:

https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ChungYingHo/Jeremy-Assets@master/{filePath}

Example:

https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ChungYingHo/Jeremy-Assets@master/jeremy-and-aira/languages/javascript/async-flow.png

